 right-opening parabola that has its vertex at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n(y-k)^{2}=4p(x-h),\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is constant.\n\nWe can rewrite the given equation as \n\n$$\n(y-0)^{2}=4(-\\frac{2}{4})(x-1),\n$$\n\nwhich simplifies to\n\n$$\n(y-0)^{2}=4(-\\frac{1}{2})(x-1).\n$$\n\nIt is now clear that our equation is of the standard type with $p=-\\frac{1}{2}.$ \n\nComparing our equation with the standard equation, we can see that we have $h=1$ and $k=0.$ Therefore, the coordinates of the vertex of the parabola are $(1,0).$"] ["question-206046fc-72eb-5e7e-8330-c7dfc01fc134" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-8abcfe54-e8c7-5c1d-9465-cff1e4813088" :answer-field/id #uuid "8abcfe54-e8c7-5c1d-9465-cff1e4813088"] ["answer-20e4a15a-eda1-52a1-8baa-9cdce6bed32e" :answer/id #uuid "20e4a15a-eda1-52a1-8baa-9cdce6bed32e"] ["answer-20e4a15a-eda1-52a1-8baa-9cdce6bed32e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-20e4a15a-eda1-52a1-8baa-9cdce6bed32e" :answer/value "(-1,-\\frac{1}{2})"] ["answer-84737793-7f74-5db9-b6ff-72f64548ee3c" :answer/id #uuid "84737793-7f74-5db9-b6ff-72f64548ee3c"] ["answer-84737793-7f74-5db9-b6ff-72f64548ee3c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-84737793-7f74-5db9-b6ff-72f64548ee3c" :answer/value "(-2,0)"] ["answer-e5f0f01f-aa87-552e-8444-03f833352b21" :answer/id #uuid "e5f0f01f-aa87-552e-8444-03f833352b21"] ["answer-e5f0f01f-aa87-552e-8444-03f833352b21" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e5f0f01f-aa87-552e-8444-03f833352b21" :answer/value "(0,-1)"] ["answer-2718af2e-0e58-5f94-b179-4b6122d8bbc8" :answer/id #uuid "2718af2e-0e58-5f94-b179-4b6122d8bbc8"] ["answer-2718af2e-0e58-5f94-b179-4b6122d8bbc8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2718af2e-0e58-5f94-b179-4b6122d8bbc8" :answer/value "(1,0)"] ["answer-959f0371-d54d-54ee-88dc-a7c52e86bcd9" :answer/id #uuid "959f0371-d54d-54ee-88dc-a7c52e86bcd9"] ["answer-959f0371-d54d-54ee-88dc-a7c52e86bcd9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-959f0371-d54d-54ee-88dc-a7c52e86bcd9" :answer